==Blurb==
A spin-off app to celebrate the eighth anniversary of the hugely popular "[[Nyanko Daisensou]]"! With Japan in their hands, the Cats plan to create the next new Japan! Build up the prefectures to create a new Japan!

【Stacking up the prefectures!】<br>
It's easy to play, just stack the prefectures that appear one by one. Shaping a new Japan.

【Share New Japan with everyone!】<br>
The new Japan is ready to share! You will be able to show off the new Japan you've created!

【You can get a reward in Nyanko Daisensou!】<br>
Share your own new Japan on social media and share it with others. The rewards that can be received in the 'Nyanyko Daisensou'! You can only receive your reward once.

For the creation of Japan! A clean download for Nyanko New Japan!


